      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-culture-identity-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "Identity is rarely a single category; people may emphasize different parts of it in different contexts without being inconsistent."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "هویت به‌ندرت فقط یک دسته‌ست؛ آدم‌ها ممکنه در زمینه‌های مختلف بخش‌های متفاوتش رو برجسته کنن بدون اینکه متناقض باشن."
        },
        "intent": "describe_identity_complexity",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_culture_identity_identity",
          "c1_culture_identity_community"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "likes-dislikes",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_culture_identity_belonging",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-culture-identity-01",
        "text": {
          "en": "A sense of belonging can come from language, place, relationships, shared experience, or several of these at once."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "احساس تعلق می‌تونه از زبان، مکان، رابطه، تجربه مشترک یا چندتاشون با هم بیاد."
        },
        "intent": "explain_belonging",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_culture_identity_belonging",
          "c1_culture_identity_identity"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "likes-dislikes",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_culture_identity_heritage",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-culture-identity-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "Maintaining a connection to heritage does not necessarily mean preserving every custom unchanged."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "حفظ ارتباط با میراث فرهنگی لزوماً یعنی نگه داشتن همه رسم‌ها بدون تغییر نیست."
        },
        "intent": "qualify_heritage",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_culture_identity_heritage",
          "c1_culture_identity_adapt"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "likes-dislikes",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_culture_identity_stereotype",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-culture-identity-02",
        "text": {
          "en": "A stereotype becomes particularly limiting when it is treated as a script individuals are expected to perform."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "کلیشه وقتی خیلی محدودکننده می‌شه که به‌عنوان نقشی در نظر گرفته بشه که انتظار دارن فرد اجراش کنه."
        },
        "intent": "analyze_stereotype",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_culture_identity_stereotype",
          "c1_culture_identity_identity"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "likes-dislikes",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_culture_identity_hybrid",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-culture-identity-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "Hybrid identities are not incomplete versions of two cultures; they can be coherent identities in their own right."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "هویت‌های ترکیبی نسخه ناقص دو فرهنگ نیستن؛ خودشون می‌تونن هویت‌های منسجم باشن."
        },
        "intent": "challenge_binary_identity",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_culture_identity_hybrid",
          "c1_culture_identity_identity"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "likes-dislikes",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_culture_identity_authentic",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-culture-identity-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "The idea of being 'authentic' becomes complicated when other people define authenticity more narrowly than the person does."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "ایده «اصیل بودن» وقتی پیچیده می‌شه که بقیه اصالت رو محدودتر از خود فرد تعریف کنن."
        },
        "intent": "question_authenticity",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_culture_identity_authentic",
          "c1_culture_identity_identity"
        ],
        "cefr": "C1",
        "topic": "likes-dislikes",
        "register": "neutral",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "utterance",
      "external_id": "u_c1_culture_identity_adapt2",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "c1-culture-identity-03",
        "text": {
          "en": "Adapting to a new community can involve learning new conventions without abandoning previous forms of belonging."
        },
        "translations": {
          "fa": "سازگار شدن با جامعه جدید می‌تونه شامل یاد گرفتن قراردادهای جدید باشه بدون اینکه تعلق‌های قبلی کنار گذاشته بشن."
        },
        "intent": "describe_adaptation",
        "concept_refs": [
          "c1_culture_identity_adapt",
